flowchart TD
 A([Start login]) --> B[/Enter credentials/]
 B --> C{Fields valid?}
 C -- No --> D[/Show error/]
 D -- Retry --> B
 C -- Yes --> E[Match stored account hash and active status]
 E --> F{Match found?}
 F -- No --> G[/Reject login/]
 F -- Yes --> H[Create session and local proof]
 H --> I[(Browser session store)]
 I -- Valid proof --> J([Open dashboard])
